Decisions: the service-role client answers only "exists?" (key column) and "test/service account?"; every card field comes from the viewer's user-scoped client (RLS). Products use the `products` table (is_active) as GET /discover/product/:id does. A post's title is its author's display name (as the viewer may see it). Shared items push like calendar invites: a catalog line, never coalesced. `ar` is a sparse locale by design (catalog.ts) and falls back to English.

