Fixed: posts only while moderation_status = 'active' (blocking); test/service accounts' posts and events restricted too; group share check after membership + retry lookup (a retried share gets its stored row; non-members get not_a_member); group shared items keep the sanitized mentions; unreadable profiles are always "restricted"; a delisted product is "deleted"; the author lookup's error → 503 (no half card); caption ≤ 1000 chars (else 400 caption_too_long); docs say {kind, id} + server reply_to.
Accepted: blocked/muted authors are filtered only in the feed (the sender's choice to share wins); the exclusion lookup is the fail-open variant (display path, as the feed); `requireAuth` makes the 401 branch defensive only.
